    "Timeline Tether (804505) ~9 times in 3 s instead of ~3. Live Ascension logs confirm Renewal rolls remaining",
    "healing plus the new contribution into a single 1 s periodic HoT preserving the existing tick cadence.",
    "Expected: stacking 3 Epochs under Aeon of Renewal + Time Beacon Rank 2 (11 s duration) increases Renewal's",
    "per-tick amount above a single Epoch while ticking only once per second (2-4 ticks in a 3 s window,",
    "reducing Fortify Timeline's cooldown via Timeline Tether by 4500-8000 ms including elapsed time)."
  ],
